--- text
Your return is approved

We approved the return on order [ORDER_NUMBER]. Print your return
label, send the items back by [RETURN_DEADLINE], and we refund
[CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT] when the parcel reaches us.

Return details

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Return deadline: [RETURN_DEADLINE]
Refund amount when received: [CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT]

Print your return label:

[RETURN_URL]

What to do next:

1. Pack the items in the box they arrived in, or any box that fits.
2. Include everything that came with them, such as cables,
manuals and accessories.
3. Attach the label to the outside of the box, and cover any old label.
4. Drop the parcel at a carrier point on or before [RETURN_DEADLINE].

Items on this return

Item: [ITEM_1_NAME]
[ITEM_1_VARIANT]
Qty: [ITEM_1_QTY]
Refund: [CURRENCY] [ITEM_1_AMOUNT]

Important: The label stops working after [RETURN_DEADLINE]. A
parcel sent after that date comes back to you, and we cannot
refund the order. If you need more time, write to us before the
deadline.

When the parcel reaches us we check the items, then refund
[CURRENCY] [REFUND_AMOUNT] to your [REFUND_METHOD]. The money
takes [REFUND_DAYS] to reach you after we send it.

If a line on this return is wrong, or the label will not print,
reply to this email, or write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person
reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
